  "prefLabel": "Abfd 301.01 Purpose",
  "priorExpiration": "2012-10-17",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Abfd 301.01 Purpose. The purpose of this chapter is to ensure, through the elimination of architectural barriers, that publicly funded public buildings and facilities are accessible to, and functional for, persons with disabilities.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Abfd 100) #5720, eff 1-1-94, EXPIRED: 1-1-00\n\nNew. #7211, INTERIM, eff 3-1-00, EXPIRED: 6-29-00\n\nNew. #7347, eff 8-19-00; ss by #8011, eff 12-19-03, EXPIRED: 12-19-11\n\nNew. #10118, INTERIM, eff 4-20-12, EXPIRED: 10-17-12\n\nNew. #10248, eff 12-22-12; ss by #13674, eff 6-23-23",
